  "description": "Erection of a self build, end of terrace, single storey, plus basement, two bed, four person house, with associated bin store, bike store, photovoltaic panels, air source heat pumps and landscaping works encompassing the creation of a new parking space. ",
  "subdivision_of_building": null,
